BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.run._proof_6","signature":"∀ (c₁ c₂ : ℝ),\n  0 < c₁ →\n    c₁ ≤ 1 / 3 →\n      c₁ < c₂ →\n        ∀ (k : ℕ),\n          BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.objective BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD\n              (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.orbitPoint (k + 1)) ≤\n            BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.objective BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD\n                (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.orbitPoint k) +\n              c₁ *\n                BfgsVerification.dot (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.orbitGradient k)\n                  (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.orbitMetric k)\n                    (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.orbitGradient k) (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.orbitLength k))","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
