BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.scalar_frame_incompatible","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F) (w : ℕ → BfgsVerification.Vec n)\n  (a b : ℕ → ℝ),\n  (∀ (k : ℕ), w (k + 1) = a k • w k + b k • R.displacement k) →\n    ∀ (m C C0 : ℝ),\n      0 < m →\n        0 ≤ C →\n          0 ≤ C0 →\n            (∀ (k : ℕ), m ≤ BfgsVerification.dot (R.g k) (w k) ^ 2) →\n              (∀ (k : ℕ), a k ^ 2 ≤ 1 + C * R.d k) →\n                (∀ (k : ℕ), BfgsVerification.dot (R.gradientChange k) (w (k + 1)) ^ 2 / R.curvature k ≤ C0) →\n                  Summable R.d → ∀ (G : ℝ), 0 < G → (∀ (k : ℕ), BfgsVerification.sqNorm (R.g k) ≤ G ^ 2) → False","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
