BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.FiniteMaxRadial.finite_max_central_isBigO","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {ι : Type u_1} [inst : Fintype ι] (hne : Finset.univ.Nonempty) {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ}\n  (f : ι → BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ) {U : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)},\n  IsOpen U →\n    ∀ {w star : BfgsVerification.Vec n},\n      w ∈ U →\n        (∀ (i : ι), ContDiffOn ℝ 2 (f i) U) →\n          (∀ z ∈ U, F z = Finset.univ.sup' hne fun i => f i z) →\n            (fun t =>\n                BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.centralDifference F star w t -\n                  BfgsVerification.FiniteMaxRadial.activeRadialJump hne f w (w - star) * |t|) =O[nhds 0]\n              fun t => t ^ 2","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
