   0 ≤ C ∧\n                                  ∃ J,\n                                    ∀ (k : ℕ),\n                                      J ≤ k →\n                                        ∃ lam β,\n                                          0 < lam ∧\n                                            BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field ⋯ χ v (R.x (k + 1)) =\n                                                lam • BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field ⋯ χ v (R.x k) +\n                                                  β • R.displacement k ∧\n                                              |Real.log lam| ≤ C * R.d k","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
