BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.fixed_normal_hessian_trace_budget","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F) {r : ℕ}\n  {Ω : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)} {a : BfgsVerification.Vec n} {A : BfgsVerification.Vec n → BfgsVerification.Vec n}\n  {μ : ℝ},\n  0 < μ →\n    BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.EuclideanStrongConvexOn Ω μ F →\n      (∀ (k : ℕ), R.x k ∈ Ω) →\n        (∀ x ∈ Ω,\n            ∀ (g : BfgsVerification.Vec n),\n              BfgsVerification.Homogeneous.Supports F x g → BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.tangentProjection a g = A x) →\n          ∀ {L : NNReal},\n            LipschitzOnWith L A Ω →\n              ∀ (U : Matrix (Fin n) (Fin r) ℝ),\n                U.transpose * U = 1 →\n                  (∀ (v : Fin n → ℝ), (U * U.transpose).mulVec v = BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.tangentProjection a v) →\n                    ∀ (k : ℕ),\n                      (BfgsVerification.metricGram (R.hessian k) U).trace ≤\n                        (BfgsVerification.metricGram (R.hessian 0) U).trace + ↑n * ↑L ^ 2 / μ * ↑k","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
