BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.centered_values","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} (A : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F) (star : BfgsVerification.Vec n),\n  (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), F star ≤ F x) →\n    ∀ {ψ γ : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} {U : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)},\n      IsOpen U →\n        ConvexOn ℝ U ψ →\n          BfgsVerification.CenteredSmoothSublinear.LocallyC11On U ψ →\n            ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ γ →\n              BfgsVerification.Homogeneous.PositiveDegreeOne γ →\n                (∀ x ∈ U, F x = ψ x + γ (x - star)) →\n                  IsCompact A.initialSublevel →\n                    A.initialSublevel ⊆ U → Filter.Tendsto (fun k => F (A.x k)) Filter.atTop (nhds (F star))","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
