BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.exists_inward_pair_approximation","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ},\n  ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ F →\n    ∀ (star : BfgsVerification.Vec n) (b : ℝ),\n      F star < b →\n        ∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n),\n          F x ≤ b →\n            ∀ {O : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)},\n              IsOpen O →\n                x ∈ O →\n                  ∀ {t : ℝ},\n                    t ≠ 1 →\n                      ∃ u,\n                        Filter.Tendsto u Filter.atTop (nhds x) ∧\n                          ∀ (j : ℕ),\n                            u j ∈ interior {w | F w ≤ b} ∧\n                              u j ∈ O ∧\n                                DifferentiableAt ℝ F (u j) ∧\n                                  DifferentiableAt ℝ F (BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.inwardPoint star (u j) t)","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
