BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.composite_projected_strong_convex","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F ψ : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} {h : ℝ → ℝ},\n  ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ h →\n    ∀ (a : BfgsVerification.Vec n) (b : ℝ) {Ω : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)} {μ : ℝ},\n      (ConvexOn ℝ Ω fun x =>\n          ψ x - μ / 2 * BfgsVerification.sqNorm (BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.tangentProjection a x)) →\n        (∀ x ∈ Ω, F x = ψ x + h (BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.normalCoordinate a b x)) →\n          ConvexOn ℝ Ω fun x =>\n            F x - μ / 2 * BfgsVerification.sqNorm (BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.tangentProjection a x)","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
