BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.maxLinear_relativeInterior_convergence","signature":"∀ {n r : ℕ} (A : Finset (BfgsVerification.Vec n)) (hA : A.Nonempty)\n  (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n (BfgsVerification.Homogeneous.finiteMaxLinear A hA)),\n  BfgsVerification.Homogeneous.RelativeInteriorZero A →\n    ∀ (U : Matrix (Fin n) (Fin r) ℝ),\n      U.transpose * U = 1 →\n        (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), x ∈ Submodule.span ℝ ↑A ↔ ∃ z, U.mulVec z = x) →\n          Filter.Tendsto (fun k => U.transpose.mulVec (R.x k)) Filter.atTop (nhds 0) ∧\n            Filter.Tendsto R.x Filter.atTop\n              (nhds (BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.fiberPoint U.transpose (R.H 0) (R.x 0) 0))","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
