BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AffineBarycentric.positive_solutions_eventually","signature":"∀ {X : Type u_1} [inst : TopologicalSpace X] {n m : ℕ} (A : X → Matrix (Fin n) (Fin m) ℝ) (x : X),\n  ContinuousAt A x →\n    Function.Injective (A x).mulVec →\n      ∀ (b : BfgsVerification.Vec n) (w0 : BfgsVerification.Vec m),\n        (A x).mulVec w0 = b →\n          (∀ (i : Fin m), 0 < w0 i) →\n            ∀ᶠ (p : X) in nhds x,\n              Function.Injective (A p).mulVec ∧\n                ∀ (w : BfgsVerification.Vec m),\n                  (A p).mulVec w = b →\n                    w = BfgsVerification.AffineBarycentric.coefficients (A p) b ∧ ∀ (i : Fin m), 0 < w i","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
