BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.TransformedGauge.radialPairing_variation_on_annulus","signature":"∀ {Φ : ℝ → ℝ},\n  BfgsVerification.TransformedGauge.IncreasingTransform Φ →\n    ∀ {a b : ℝ},\n      0 < a →\n        ∃ C,\n          0 < C ∧\n            ∀ r ∈ Set.Icc a b,\n              ∀ s ∈ Set.Icc a b,\n                s ≤ r →\n                  |BfgsVerification.TransformedGauge.radialPairing Φ s -\n                        BfgsVerification.TransformedGauge.radialPairing Φ r| ≤\n                    C * (Φ r - Φ s)","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
