BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.structured_field_segment_transport","signature":"∀ {F : BfgsVerification.Vec 2 → ℝ} (hF : ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ F) {m : ℕ} {χ : Fin m → BfgsVerification.Vec 2 → ℝ}\n  {v : Fin m → ℝ → BfgsVerification.Vec 2} {Q : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec 2)} {x s g : BfgsVerification.Vec 2}\n  {η G M A κ d : ℝ},\n  (∀ (i : Fin m), ContDiff ℝ (↑⊤) (χ i)) →\n    s ≠ 0 →\n      (∀ q ∈ Q, ∀ (i : Fin m), ContDiffAt ℝ 1 (v i) (F q)) →\n        (∀ q ∈ Q,\n            ContDiffAt ℝ 2 F q ∨\n              ∃ i,\n                ∀ᶠ (z : BfgsVerification.Vec 2) in nhds q,\n                  BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v z = v i (F z)) →\n          (∀ q ∈ Q, ContinuousAt (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v) q) →\n            0 < η →\n              0 < G →\n                0 ≤ A →\n                  0 < κ →\n                    (∀ q ∈ Q,\n                        ∀ a ∈ BfgsVerification.ConvexSubdifferential.subdifferential F q,\n                          η ≤ BfgsVerification.dot a (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v q)) →\n                      (∀ q ∈ Q,\n                          BfgsVerification.sqNorm (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v q) ≤ G ^ 2) →\n                        (∀ q ∈ Q, ‖fderiv ℝ (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v) q‖ ≤ M) →\n                          (∀ q ∈ Q, ∀ (i : Fin m), ‖BfgsVerification.euclideanVector (deriv (v i) (F q))‖ ≤ A) →\n                            (∀ t ∈ Set.Icc 0 1, x + t • s ∈ Q) →\n                              (∀ t ∈ Set.Icc 0 1,\n                                  κ * ‖BfgsVerification.euclideanVector s‖ ≤\n                                    |BfgsVerification.HomogeneousPlanar.pairDet s\n                                        (BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v (x + t • s))|) →\n                                HasFDerivAt F (BfgsVerification.gradientFunctional g) x →\n                                  0 ≤ d →\n                                    BfgsVerification.dot g s = -d →\n                                      F (x + s) ≤ F x →\n                                        ∃ lam β,\n                                          0 < lam ∧\n                                            BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v (x + s) =\n                                                lam • BfgsVerification.PlanarObjectiveField.field hF χ v x + β • s ∧\n                                              |Real.log lam| ≤ 2 * max (6 * M / (κ * (η / G))) (A / κ) * d","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
