BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.projected_update","signature":"∀ {n r : ℕ} (A : Matrix (Fin r) (Fin n) ℝ),\n  BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.FullRowRank A →\n    ∀ (F : BfgsVerification.Vec r → ℝ) (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n fun x => F (A.mulVec x)) (k : ℕ),\n      BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.compress A (R.H (k + 1)) =\n        BfgsVerification.inverseBFGS (BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.compress A (R.H k))\n          (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep (BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.compress A (R.H k))\n            (BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.projectedGradient A F R k) (R.α k))\n          (BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.projectedGradient A F R (k + 1) -\n            BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.projectedGradient A F R k)","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
