BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.FivePieceObstruction.obstruction_in_every_neighborhood","signature":"∀ K ∈ nhds 0,\n  ∃ τ,\n    0 < τ ∧\n      BfgsVerification.FivePieceObstruction.ray τ 0 ∈ K ∧\n        Matrix.PosDef (BfgsVerification.FivePieceObstruction.initialMetric τ) ∧\n          HasFDerivAt BfgsVerification.FivePieceObstruction.objective\n              (BfgsVerification.gradientFunctional BfgsVerification.FivePieceObstruction.initialGradient)\n              (BfgsVerification.FivePieceObstruction.ray τ 0) ∧\n            ∀ (α : ℝ),\n              0 < α →\n                ∀ (g : BfgsVerification.Vec 3),\n                  HasFDerivAt BfgsVerification.FivePieceObstruction.objective (BfgsVerification.gradientFunctional g)\n                      (BfgsVerification.FivePieceObstruction.ray τ α) →\n                    ¬(BfgsVerification.FivePieceObstruction.objective (BfgsVerification.FivePieceObstruction.ray τ α) ≤\n                          BfgsVerification.FivePieceObstruction.objective\n                              (BfgsVerification.FivePieceObstruction.ray τ 0) +\n                            1 / 4 *\n                              BfgsVerification.dot BfgsVerification.FivePieceObstruction.initialGradient\n                                (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep (BfgsVerification.FivePieceObstruction.initialMetric τ)\n                                  BfgsVerification.FivePieceObstruction.initialGradient α) ∧\n                        1 / 2 *\n                            BfgsVerification.dot BfgsVerification.FivePieceObstruction.initialGradient\n                              (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep (BfgsVerification.FivePieceObstruction.initialMetric τ)\n                                BfgsVerification.FivePieceObstruction.initialGradient α) ≤\n                          BfgsVerification.dot g\n                            (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep (BfgsVerification.FivePieceObstruction.initialMetric τ)\n                              BfgsVerification.FivePieceObstruction.initialGradient α))","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
