BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.centered_uniform_correction","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} (A : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F) (star : BfgsVerification.Vec n)\n  {ψ γ : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} {U : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)},\n  IsOpen U →\n    ConvexOn ℝ U ψ →\n      BfgsVerification.CenteredSmoothSublinear.LocallyC11On U ψ →\n        ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ γ →\n          BfgsVerification.Homogeneous.PositiveDegreeOne γ →\n            (∀ x ∈ U, F x = ψ x + γ (x - star)) →\n              IsCompact A.initialSublevel →\n                A.initialSublevel ⊆ U →\n                  ∃ L G R, 0 < L ∧ 0 < G ∧ 0 < R ∧ ∀ (k : ℕ), A.referenceCorrection star k ≤ L * R ^ 2 + 2 * G * R","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
