BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.projected_displacement_budget","signature":"∀ {n m : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F)\n  (P : BfgsVerification.Vec n →ₗ[ℝ] BfgsVerification.Vec m) {U : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)} {μ : ℝ},\n  (ConvexOn ℝ U fun x => F x - μ / 2 * BfgsVerification.sqNorm (P x)) →\n    (∀ (k : ℕ), R.x k ∈ U) →\n      ∀ (k : ℕ), μ / 2 * BfgsVerification.sqNorm (P (R.displacement k)) ≤ R.d k - (F (R.x k) - F (R.x (k + 1)))","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
