BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.PlanarNormalGeometry.exists_moving_normalSector_cutoffs","signature":"∀ {m : ℕ} (a b v : Fin m → ℝ → BfgsVerification.Vec 2) (t : ℝ),\n  (∀ (i : Fin m), ContinuousAt (a i) t) →\n    (∀ (i : Fin m), ContinuousAt (b i) t) →\n      (∀ (i : Fin m), ContinuousAt (v i) t) →\n        (∀ (i : Fin m), BfgsVerification.dot (a i t) (v i t) = 1) →\n          (∀ (i : Fin m), BfgsVerification.dot (b i t) (v i t) = 1) →\n            (Pairwise fun i j =>\n                Disjoint (BfgsVerification.PlanarNormalGeometry.normalSector (a i t) (b i t))\n                  (BfgsVerification.PlanarNormalGeometry.normalSector (a j t) (b j t))) →\n              ∃ χ η,\n                (∀ (i : Fin m), ContDiff ℝ (↑⊤) (χ i)) ∧\n                  (∀ (i : Fin m), 0 < η i) ∧\n                    (∀ (i : Fin m) (w : BfgsVerification.Vec 2), χ i w ∈ Set.Icc 0 1) ∧\n                      (Pairwise fun i j => Disjoint (tsupport (χ i)) (tsupport (χ j))) ∧\n                        ∀ᶠ (s : ℝ) in nhds t,\n                          ∀ (i : Fin m),\n                            (∀ w ∈ BfgsVerification.PlanarNormalGeometry.normalSector (a i s) (b i s),\n                                ∀ᶠ (z : BfgsVerification.Vec 2) in nhds w, χ i z = 1) ∧\n                              ∀ (w : BfgsVerification.Vec 2),\n                                BfgsVerification.sqNorm w ≤ 1 → χ i w ≠ 0 → η i ≤ BfgsVerification.dot w (v i s)","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
