BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.projectRun._proof_8","signature":"∀ {n r : ℕ} (A : Matrix (Fin r) (Fin n) ℝ),\n  BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.FullRowRank A →\n    ∀ (F : BfgsVerification.Vec r → ℝ) (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n fun x => F (A.mulVec x)) (k : ℕ),\n      F (A.mulVec (R.x (k + 1))) ≤\n        F (A.mulVec (R.x k)) +\n          R.c₁ *\n            BfgsVerification.dot (BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.projectedGradient A F R k)\n              (BfgsVerification.bfgsStep (BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.compress A (R.H k))\n                (BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.projectedGradient A F R k) (R.α k))","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
