BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.maxLinear_recurrent_relativeInterior_convergence","signature":"∀ {n r : ℕ} (A B : Finset (BfgsVerification.Vec n)) (hA : A.Nonempty),\n  B.Nonempty →\n    ∀ (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n (BfgsVerification.Homogeneous.finiteMaxLinear A hA)),\n      ↑B = BfgsVerification.Homogeneous.recurrentValues R.g →\n        BfgsVerification.Homogeneous.RelativeInteriorZero B →\n          ∀ (U : Matrix (Fin n) (Fin r) ℝ),\n            U.transpose * U = 1 →\n              (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), x ∈ Submodule.span ℝ ↑B ↔ ∃ z, U.mulVec z = x) →\n                ∃ J,\n                  Filter.Tendsto R.x Filter.atTop\n                      (nhds (BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.fiberPoint U.transpose (R.H J) (R.x J) 0)) ∧\n                    Filter.Tendsto (fun k => BfgsVerification.Homogeneous.finiteMaxLinear A hA (R.x k)) Filter.atTop\n                        (nhds 0) ∧\n                      BfgsVerification.Homogeneous.finiteMaxLinear A hA\n                          (BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.fiberPoint U.transpose (R.H J) (R.x J) 0) =\n                        0","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
