BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.continuousOn_maskedNormalDerivative","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} {Ω : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)},\n  IsOpen Ω →\n    ∀ (a : BfgsVerification.Vec n) (b : ℝ) {E : Set ℝ},\n      IsClosed E →\n        BfgsVerification.CenteredSmoothSublinear.LocallyC11On (BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.regularRegion Ω a b E) F →\n          ∀ {τ : ℝ → ℝ},\n            Continuous τ →\n              ∀ {δ : ℝ},\n                0 < δ →\n                  (∀ (t e : ℝ), e ∈ E → |t - e| ≤ δ → τ t = 0) →\n                    ContinuousOn (BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.maskedNormalDerivative F a b τ) Ω","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
