BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.maxLinear_opposite_block_norm_bound","signature":"∀ (A : Finset (BfgsVerification.Vec 2)) (hA : A.Nonempty)\n  (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun 2 (BfgsVerification.Homogeneous.finiteMaxLinear A hA)),\n  (∀ (k : ℕ), 0 < BfgsVerification.Homogeneous.finiteMaxLinear A hA (R.x k)) →\n    ∀ (N : ℕ),\n      1 ≤ N →\n        (∀ k < N, BfgsVerification.HomogeneousPlanar.pairDet (R.g k) (R.g (k + 1)) = 0) →\n          ∀ (κ : ℝ),\n            0 < κ →\n              R.g 1 = -κ • R.g 0 →\n                ∀ k ≤ N + 1, ‖R.x k‖ ≤ (1 + (1 + 1 / κ) / R.c₁) * ‖R.x 0‖ + (1 + 1 / κ) / R.c₁ * ‖R.x (N + 1)‖","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
