BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.radial_curvature_le_of_pair_bound","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} (a x : BfgsVerification.Vec n),\n  0 < BfgsVerification.dot a x →\n    ∀ {C θ : ℝ},\n      0 < θ →\n        θ ≤ 1 / 2 →\n          (∀ (t : ℝ),\n              0 < t →\n                t ≤ θ →\n                  BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.radialNumerator 0 ((1 - t) • x)\n                        (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.positiveGradient a x)\n                        (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.positiveGradient a ((1 - t) • x)) ^\n                      2 ≤\n                    C *\n                      BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.secantCurvature x ((1 - t) • x)\n                        (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.positiveGradient a x)\n                        (BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.positiveGradient a ((1 - t) • x))) →\n            BfgsVerification.sqNorm x +\n                BfgsVerification.dot a x ^ 2 * BfgsVerification.NormalSpike.density (BfgsVerification.dot a x) ≤\n              4 * C","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
