BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.SeedCycle.beta_quarter","signature":"∀ {c d : ℝ},\n  BfgsVerification.AlgebraicSeed.U c d ≠ 0 →\n    BfgsVerification.AlgebraicSeed.V c d ≠ 0 →\n      BfgsVerification.AlgebraicSeed.U c d + 129 ≠ 0 →\n        264192 * BfgsVerification.AlgebraicSeed.R c d * BfgsVerification.AlgebraicSeed.K c d -\n              BfgsVerification.AlgebraicSeed.U c d * BfgsVerification.AlgebraicSeed.V c d *\n                (BfgsVerification.AlgebraicSeed.U c d + 129) =\n            0 →\n          BfgsVerification.SeedCycle.beta c d = 1 / 4","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
