BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.Parabolic.Family.exists_uniform_vector_transport","signature":"∀ {m : ℕ} (P : BfgsVerification.Parabolic.Family m) {K : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec 2)},\n  IsCompact K →\n    ∀ {η c₁ c₂ : ℝ},\n      0 < η →\n        0 ≤ c₁ →\n          c₂ < 1 →\n            ∃ L δ,\n              0 ≤ L ∧\n                0 < δ ∧\n                  δ ≤ 1 ∧\n                    ∀ x ∈ K,\n                      ∀ z ∈ K,\n                        ∀ (g h : BfgsVerification.Vec 2),\n                          BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.EligiblePair P.objective c₁ c₂ x z g h →\n                            η ≤ P.objective x →\n                              η ≤ P.objective z →\n                                BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.pairDecrease x z g ≤ δ →\n                                  ∃ ell β,\n                                    P.calibratedVector z =\n                                        ell • P.calibratedVector x +\n                                          β • BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.pairStep x z ∧\n                                      ell ^ 2 ≤ 1 + L * BfgsVerification.TransportedCertificate.pairDecrease x z g","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
