BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.reference_linear_budget_sqrt_bound","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F) (star : BfgsVerification.Vec n),\n  (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), F star ≤ F x) →\n    ∀ (C : ℝ) {N : ℕ},\n      0 < N →\n        ∑ k ∈ Finset.range N, R.referenceCorrection star k ≤ C * ↑N →\n          F (R.x N) - F star ≤ √((R.referenceEnergy star 0 + C * ↑N) / ∑ k ∈ Finset.range N, (R.q k)⁻¹)","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
