BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.projectRun_limit_lift","signature":"∀ {n r : ℕ} (A : Matrix (Fin r) (Fin n) ℝ) (hA : BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.FullRowRank A)\n  (F : BfgsVerification.Vec r → ℝ) (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n fun x => F (A.mulVec x))\n  (zstar : BfgsVerification.Vec r),\n  Filter.Tendsto (BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.projectRun A hA F R).x Filter.atTop (nhds zstar) →\n    Filter.Tendsto R.x Filter.atTop (nhds (BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.fiberPoint A (R.H 0) (R.x 0) zstar)) ∧\n      A.mulVec (BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.fiberPoint A (R.H 0) (R.x 0) zstar) = zstar ∧\n        ∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n),\n          A.mulVec x = zstar →\n            BfgsVerification.metricEnergy (R.H 0)⁻¹\n                  (BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.fiberPoint A (R.H 0) (R.x 0) zstar - R.x 0) ≤\n                BfgsVerification.metricEnergy (R.H 0)⁻¹ (x - R.x 0) ∧\n              (BfgsVerification.metricEnergy (R.H 0)⁻¹ (x - R.x 0) =\n                  BfgsVerification.metricEnergy (R.H 0)⁻¹\n                    (BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.fiberPoint A (R.H 0) (R.x 0) zstar - R.x 0) ↔\n                x = BfgsVerification.AffineProjection.fiberPoint A (R.H 0) (R.x 0) zstar)","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
