BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.RadialPower.powered_radial_hasDerivAt","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {γ : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ},\n  BfgsVerification.Homogeneous.PositiveDegreeOne γ →\n    (∀ (z : BfgsVerification.Vec n), 0 ≤ γ z) →\n      ∀ (p : ℝ) (z : BfgsVerification.Vec n) {t : ℝ},\n        t < 1 →\n          HasDerivAt (fun u => BfgsVerification.RadialPower.powered γ p ((1 - u) • z))\n            (-p * (1 - t) ^ (p - 1) * BfgsVerification.RadialPower.powered γ p z) t","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
