BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.radial_of_central_on_smaller_sublevel","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ},\n  ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ F →\n    ∀ (star : BfgsVerification.Vec n),\n      (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), F star ≤ F x) →\n        ∀ (b b' : ℝ),\n          b' < b →\n            IsCompact {x | F x ≤ b} →\n              BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.HasNestedCentralBounds F star b →\n                BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.HasRadialSecantBounds F {x | F x ≤ b'} star","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
