BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.RadialPower.actual_radial_pairing","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {ι : Type u_1} [inst : Fintype ι] {F ψ : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} {Γ : ι → BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ},\n  (∀ (j : ι), BfgsVerification.Homogeneous.PositiveDegreeOne (Γ j)) →\n    (∀ (j : ι) (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), 0 ≤ Γ j x) →\n      ∀ (p : ι → ℝ) (star : BfgsVerification.Vec n) {U : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)},\n        IsOpen U →\n          (∀ x ∈ U, F x = ψ x + BfgsVerification.RadialPower.sumObjective Γ p star x) →\n            ∀ {x g : BfgsVerification.Vec n},\n              x ∈ U →\n                HasFDerivAt F (BfgsVerification.gradientFunctional g) x →\n                  DifferentiableAt ℝ ψ x →\n                    BfgsVerification.dot g (x - star) =\n                      (fderiv ℝ ψ x) (x - star) + ∑ j, p j * BfgsVerification.RadialPower.powered (Γ j) (p j) (x - star)","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
