BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.compact_value_log_orders_of_correction_bound","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F) (star : BfgsVerification.Vec n),\n  (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), F star ≤ F x) →\n    IsCompact R.initialSublevel →\n      ∀ (C : ℝ),\n        0 ≤ C →\n          (∀ (k : ℕ), R.referenceCorrection star k ≤ C * (F (R.x (k + 1)) - F star)) →\n            ((fun N => F (R.x N) - F star) =o[Filter.atTop] fun N => Real.log ↑N / ↑N) ∧\n              (fun N => F (R.x N) - F star) =O[Filter.atTop] fun N => Real.log ↑N / ↑N","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
