on.SeedOrbit.gradient BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD\n                    (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.trialPhase q))\n                  c₂ (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.trialLength q)","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
