BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.centered_iterates","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} (A : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F) (star : BfgsVerification.Vec n),\n  (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), F star ≤ F x) →\n    (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), F x = F star → x = star) →\n      ∀ {ψ γ : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} {U : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)},\n        IsOpen U →\n          ConvexOn ℝ U ψ →\n            BfgsVerification.CenteredSmoothSublinear.LocallyC11On U ψ →\n              ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ γ →\n                BfgsVerification.Homogeneous.PositiveDegreeOne γ →\n                  (∀ x ∈ U, F x = ψ x + γ (x - star)) →\n                    IsCompact A.initialSublevel → A.initialSublevel ⊆ U → Filter.Tendsto A.x Filter.atTop (nhds star)","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
