BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.compact_value_rate_of_linear_corrections","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F) (star : BfgsVerification.Vec n),\n  (∀ (x : BfgsVerification.Vec n), F star ≤ F x) →\n    IsCompact R.initialSublevel →\n      ∀ (C : ℝ),\n        (∀ᶠ (N : ℕ) in Filter.atTop, ∑ k ∈ Finset.range N, R.referenceCorrection star k ≤ C * ↑N) →\n          Filter.Tendsto (fun N => √↑N * (F (R.x N) - F star)) Filter.atTop (nhds 0)","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
