 - r)⁻¹ + 0 * 0)) ∧\n                        0 < 2 - ((r * d - 1 / 64) * (1 - r)⁻¹ + 0 * 0) ∧\n                          0 <\n                            1 * ((897 / 1024 - r * (1 - c)) * (1 - r)⁻¹ + 0 * -1) +\n                              0 * ((r * d - 1 / 64) * (1 - r)⁻¹ + 0 * 0)","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
