BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.PointwiseFeasibility.uniformDirections_of_uniformPSD","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {α : Type u_1} {β : α → Type u_2} {h : α → BfgsVerification.Vec n}\n  {y : (z : α) → β z → BfgsVerification.Vec n} {t : (z : α) → β z → ℝ},\n  (∀ (z : α) (j : β z), 0 ≤ t z j) →\n    BfgsVerification.PointwiseFeasibility.UniformPSD h y t →\n      BfgsVerification.PointwiseFeasibility.UniformDirections h y t","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
