BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.coercive_scaled_search","signature":"∀ {t c₁ c₂ : ℝ},\n  0 < t →\n    t ≤ 1 →\n      0 < c₁ →\n        c₁ ≤ 1 / 3 →\n          0 < c₂ →\n            ∀ (j : Fin 3),\n              BfgsVerification.DeterministicLineSearch.search BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.coerciveObjective\n                  (t •\n                    BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.point BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD\n                      BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedRatio j)\n                  (t •\n                    BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.direction BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC\n                      BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedRatio j)\n                  (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.gradient BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedC BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.seedD\n                    j)\n                  c₁ c₂ 5 0 none 1 =\n                (some (BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.length j), BfgsVerification.SeedOrbit.trialHistory j)","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
