BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.FiniteMaxRadial.local_finite_max_inward","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {ι : Type u_1} [inst : Fintype ι] (hne : Finset.univ.Nonempty) {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ},\n  ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ F →\n    ∀ (f : ι → BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ) {U : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)},\n      IsOpen U →\n        (∀ (i : ι), ContDiffOn ℝ 2 (f i) U) →\n          ∀ {star : BfgsVerification.Vec n},\n            star ∈ U →\n              (∀ w ∈ U, F w = Finset.univ.sup' hne fun i => f i w) →\n                (∀ w ∈ U,\n                    ∀ (i j : ι),\n                      f i w = F w → f j w = F w → (fderiv ℝ (f i) w) (w - star) = (fderiv ℝ (f j) w) (w - star)) →\n                  ∃ r,\n                    0 < r ∧ ∀ K ⊆ Metric.ball star r, BfgsVerification.RadialCertificate.HasInwardTaylorBounds F K star","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
