BFGS_AUDIT {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.tangential_cutoff_residual_budget","signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F) {r : ℕ}\n  {Ω : Set (BfgsVerification.Vec n)} {a : BfgsVerification.Vec n} {μ : ℝ},\n  0 < μ →\n    (ConvexOn ℝ Ω fun x => F x - μ / 2 * BfgsVerification.sqNorm (BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.tangentProjection a x)) →\n      (∀ (k : ℕ), R.x k ∈ Ω) →\n        ∀ {τ : ℝ → ℝ} {L : NNReal},\n          LipschitzWith L τ →\n            ∀ (b : ℝ) (k : ℕ),\n              BfgsVerification.SmoothSubspace.frobSq\n                  (BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.cutoffResidual a (R.displacement k)\n                    (BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.cutoffSlope τ\n                      (BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.normalCoordinate a b (R.x k))\n                      (BfgsVerification.FixedNormal.normalCoordinate a b (R.x (k + 1))))) ≤\n                2 * ↑L ^ 2 / μ * R.d k","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
